WEBVTT

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:03.480
at the betrayal by
the same powerful white men

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:07.680
who tell them that their skin color

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:12.176
is their ticket to a good life and power,

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:15.016
only to discover,

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:18.496
as the circle of whiteness narrows,

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:21.696
that their tickets have expired

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.440
and no longer carry first-class status.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.640
Now that we've touched the hurt,